{"title":"Career Roadmap · Audit Assistant","role":"Audit Assistant","summary":"An Audit Assistant supports auditors in examining financial records, internal controls, transactions and supporting documentation to determine whether financial information is accurate and properly supported.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)","Course":"Banking, Accounting & Finance (BAF)"},"about":[{"label":"Alignment","text":"Very Strong"},{"label":"Typical Entry Level","text":"Audit Assistant / Audit Associate / Junior Audit Executive"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An Audit Assistant supports auditors in examining financial records, internal controls, transactions and supporting documentation to determine whether financial information is accurate and properly supported."},{"type":"p","text":"For B.Com Banking, Accounting & Finance (BAF), this is a highly relevant career because the degree provides a foundation in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial accounting"},{"text":"Cost accounting"},{"text":"Auditing"},{"text":"Taxation"},{"text":"Financial management"},{"text":"Business law"},{"text":"Banking and finance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The role can lead toward external audit, internal audit, statutory audit, tax audit, risk, compliance and financial controls."},{"type":"note","label":"A key distinction","text":"an Audit Assistant is an entry-level support role. Becoming a statutory auditor with professional signing authority is a different professional pathway and may require the relevant professional qualification and regulatory requirements."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizon","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Role","Main Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Accounting/Audit Intern"},{"text":"Accounting fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Audit Intern"},{"text":"Audit procedures"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Audit/Tax Intern"},{"text":"Working papers & controls"}],[{"text":"Graduation"},{"text":"Audit Assistant"},{"text":"Audit execution support"}],[{"text":"2–4 Years"},{"text":"Audit Associate / Senior Audit Assistant"},{"text":"Independent audit sections"}],[{"text":"4–7 Years"},{"text":"Senior Auditor / Audit Executive"},{"text":"Complex assignments"}],[{"text":"7–10 Years"},{"text":"Audit Manager"},{"text":"Engagement management"}],[{"text":"10+ Years"},{"text":"Senior Manager / Director / Partner Track"},{"text":"Audit leadership"}]]}]},{"heading":"What Does an Audit Assistant Do?","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Checking accounting records."},{"text":"Examining invoices and supporting documents."},{"text":"Performing ledger scrutiny."},{"text":"Testing transactions."},{"text":"Preparing audit working papers."},{"text":"Performing bank reconciliations."},{"text":"Checking accounts receivable/payable."},{"text":"Verifying fixed assets."},{"text":"Testing internal controls."},{"text":"Performing analytical procedures."},{"text":"Supporting statutory audits."},{"text":"Supporting internal audits."},{"text":"Identifying discrepancies."},{"text":"Documenting audit evidence."},{"text":"Following up on audit observations."},{"text":"Communicating with client finance teams."},{"text":"Preparing audit schedules."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Typical Audit Workflow"},{"type":"h","text":"Understand Business & Risks"},{"type":"h","text":"Understand Internal Controls"},{"type":"h","text":"Plan Audit Procedures"},{"type":"h","text":"Collect Audit Evidence"},{"type":"h","text":"Test Transactions/Balances"},{"type":"h","text":"Identify Exceptions"},{"type":"h","text":"Document Working Papers"},{"type":"h","text":"Resolve Queries"},{"type":"h","text":"Review"},{"type":"h","text":"Audit Conclusion/Report"}]},{"heading":"Build Skills During B.Com","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Accounting Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"h","text":"Financial Accounting"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Journal entries"},{"text":"Ledgers"},{"text":"Trial balance"},{"text":"Profit & loss statement"},{"text":"Balance sheet"},{"text":"Cash-flow statement"},{"text":"Depreciation"},{"text":"Provisions"},{"text":"Accruals"},{"text":"Prepayments"},{"text":"Receivables"},{"text":"Payables"},{"text":"Inventory accounting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Finance"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Working capital"},{"text":"Capital budgeting"},{"text":"Financial ratios"},{"text":"Cost of capital"},{"text":"Cash-flow analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A good auditor needs to understand why an accounting entry exists, not just how to record it."}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Auditing Fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Audit objectives"},{"text":"Audit planning"},{"text":"Audit evidence"},{"text":"Audit risk"},{"text":"Materiality"},{"text":"Sampling"},{"text":"Internal controls"},{"text":"Substantive procedures"},{"text":"Analytical procedures"},{"text":"Vouching"},{"text":"Verification"},{"text":"Reconciliation"},{"text":"Audit documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Understand the difference between:"},{"type":"h","text":"Vouching"},{"type":"p","text":"Checking whether recorded transactions are supported by appropriate documentary evidence."},{"type":"h","text":"Verification"},{"type":"p","text":"Checking the existence, ownership, valuation and other relevant assertions relating to assets/liabilities."},{"type":"h","text":"Reconciliation"},{"type":"p","text":"Comparing two records and investigating differences."}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Practical Audit Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to audit major financial statement areas."},{"type":"h","text":"Cash & Bank"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Bank reconciliation"},{"text":"Bank confirmations"},{"text":"Cash verification"},{"text":"Unusual transactions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Receivables"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer balances"},{"text":"Ageing"},{"text":"Confirmations"},{"text":"Provision for doubtful debts"},{"text":"Subsequent receipts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Payables"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Supplier balances"},{"text":"Unrecorded liabilities"},{"text":"Invoice matching"},{"text":"Cut-off testing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Inventory"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Stock records"},{"text":"Physical verification"},{"text":"Valuation"},{"text":"Slow-moving inventory"},{"text":"Cut-off"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Fixed Assets"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Asset register"},{"text":"Additions"},{"text":"Disposals"},{"text":"Depreciation"},{"text":"Physical existence"}]}]},{"heading":"Final Year — Controls, Tax & Analytics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Internal Controls"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Segregation of duties"},{"text":"Authorisation"},{"text":"Access controls"},{"text":"Maker-checker controls"},{"text":"Reconciliations"},{"text":"Approval workflows"},{"text":"Exception reporting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Risk-based Auditing"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to think:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Risk","Control","Test","Evidence","Finding"]},{"type":"h","text":"Taxation"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop basic knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Income tax"},{"text":"GST"},{"text":"TDS"},{"text":"Tax deductions"},{"text":"Tax documentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact tax rules and thresholds change, so students should use current official guidance when applying tax rules professionally."}]},{"heading":"Four-Year Development Plan","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Area","Year 1","Year 2","Year 3","Year 4"],"rows":[[{"text":"Accounting"},{"text":"Fundamentals"},{"text":"Intermediate"},{"text":"Advanced"},{"text":"Practical"}],[{"text":"Auditing"},{"text":"Introduction"},{"text":"Fundamentals"},{"text":"Advanced"},{"text":"Applied"}],[{"text":"Financial Statements"},{"text":"Preparation"},{"text":"Analysis"},{"text":"Audit"},{"text":"Review"}],[{"text":"Internal Controls"},{"text":"Basics"},{"text":"Introduction"},{"text":"Advanced"},{"text":"Testing"}],[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Basics"},{"text":"Intermediate"},{"text":"Advanced"},{"text":"Automation"}],[{"text":"Taxation"},{"text":"Basics"},{"text":"Intermediate"},{"text":"Practical"},{"text":"Applied"}],[{"text":"Audit Documentation"},{"text":"—"},{"text":"Basics"},{"text":"Advanced"},{"text":"Professional"}],[{"text":"Risk"},{"text":"Introduction"},{"text":"Basics"},{"text":"Intermediate"},{"text":"Risk-based audit"}],[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"—"},{"text":"Basics"},{"text":"Intermediate"},{"text":"Audit analytics"}],[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"—"},{"text":"Basics"},{"text":"Intermediate"},{"text":"Data testing"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Basic"},{"text":"Professional"},{"text":"Client-facing"},{"text":"Professional reporting"}]]}]},{"heading":"Practical Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Complete Financial Statement Audit Case"},{"type":"p","text":"Use a fictional company and prepare:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Trial balance"},{"text":"Financial statements"},{"text":"Audit plan"},{"text":"Risk assessment"},{"text":"Audit procedures"},{"text":"Working papers"},{"text":"Audit findings"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Bank Reconciliation Audit"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a simulated bank reconciliation containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Unpresented cheques"},{"text":"Deposits in transit"},{"text":"Bank charges"},{"text":"Direct credits"},{"text":"Errors"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Identify and document the exceptions."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Accounts Receivable Audit"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer balances"},{"text":"Ageing"},{"text":"Overdue invoices"},{"text":"Credit notes"},{"text":"Subsequent collections"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Identify potentially risky balances."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Internal Control Assessment"},{"type":"p","text":"Select a process such as:"},{"type":"h","text":"Procure-to-Pay"},{"type":"p","text":"Map:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Purchase Request","Approval","Purchase Order","Goods Receipt","Invoice","Payment"]},{"type":"p","text":"Identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Control points"},{"text":"Risks"},{"text":"Control weaknesses"},{"text":"Suggested improvements"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Audit Analytics Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Use Excel/Power BI to analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Expenses"},{"text":"Transactions"},{"text":"Journal entries"},{"text":"Receivables"},{"text":"Payables"},{"text":"Exception counts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Duplicate transactions"},{"text":"Unusual transactions"},{"text":"Large-value entries"},{"text":"Weekend/holiday transactions"},{"text":"Unusual account activity"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use synthetic or public data rather than confidential financial records."}]},{"heading":"Important Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Importance"],"rows":[[{"text":"Accounting"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Auditing"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Financial Statements"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Audit Working Papers"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Internal Controls"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Analytical Thinking"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Tax Fundamentals"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Risk Assessment"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Audit Analytics"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"ERP/SAP"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}]]}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Start applying from 2nd year, with serious audit exposure during 3rd year."},{"type":"h","text":"Target internships"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Audit Intern"},{"text":"Internal Audit Intern"},{"text":"Tax Audit Intern"},{"text":"Accounting Intern"},{"text":"Risk & Compliance Intern"},{"text":"Finance Intern"},{"text":"Assurance Intern"},{"text":"Audit Analytics Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Where to apply"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Audit firms"},{"text":"Accounting firms"},{"text":"Consulting firms"},{"text":"Corporate internal-audit departments"},{"text":"Banks"},{"text":"NBFCs"},{"text":"Financial-services companies"},{"text":"Manufacturing companies"},{"text":"IT companies"},{"text":"Startups"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A good internship should expose the student to:"},{"type":"flow","items":["working papers","vouching","reconciliations","controls","financial statements","audit documentation."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Professional Qualifications","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For entry-level audit, practical knowledge can be enough, but professional qualifications can significantly expand career opportunities."},{"type":"h","text":"Accounting & Audit"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential pathways include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CA"},{"text":"CMA"},{"text":"ACCA"},{"text":"CIA"},{"text":"CPA, subject to applicable jurisdiction/eligibility"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful supporting skills:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Audit analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Important distinction"},{"type":"p","text":"A B.Com graduate can work as an Audit Assistant/Associate, but should not assume that the B.Com degree by itself provides professional authority to sign statutory audit reports."},{"type":"p","text":"Professional signing/regulated audit responsibilities depend on the applicable professional qualification, registration and legal requirements."}]},{"heading":"Jobs You Can Be Hired For","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Direct Entry"},{"type":"p","text":"A B.Com BAF graduate can target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Audit Assistant"},{"text":"Audit Associate"},{"text":"Junior Audit Executive"},{"text":"Audit Executive – Junior"},{"text":"Assurance Associate"},{"text":"Internal Audit Assistant"},{"text":"Internal Audit Associate"},{"text":"Accounts & Audit Executive"},{"text":"Audit Trainee"},{"text":"Tax Audit Assistant"},{"text":"Finance & Audit Associate"},{"text":"Risk & Compliance Associate"},{"text":"Junior Internal Auditor"},{"text":"Audit Analyst – Junior"},{"text":"Financial Control Associate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"With Analytics Skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Audit Data Analyst"},{"text":"Financial Controls Analyst"},{"text":"Risk Analyst"},{"text":"Internal Controls Analyst"},{"text":"Compliance Analyst"},{"text":"Forensic Audit Analyst – Junior"}]}]},{"heading":"Specialisation Options","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Statutory / External Audit"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial statements"},{"text":"Audit evidence"},{"text":"Accounting standards"},{"text":"Audit procedures"},{"text":"Reporting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Career:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Audit Assistant","Audit Associate","Senior Auditor","Audit Manager","Senior Manager"]},{"type":"h","text":"Internal Audit"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Internal controls"},{"text":"Process risks"},{"text":"Operational audits"},{"text":"Compliance"},{"text":"Risk management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Career:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Internal Audit Associate","Internal Auditor","Senior Internal Auditor","Internal Audit Manager","Head of Internal Audit"]},{"type":"h","text":"Tax Audit"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Tax records"},{"text":"GST"},{"text":"TDS"},{"text":"Income-tax compliance"},{"text":"Tax documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Risk & Compliance"},{"type":"p","text":"Combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Audit","Risk","Internal Controls","Compliance"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential roles:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Risk Analyst"},{"text":"Compliance Analyst"},{"text":"Controls Analyst"},{"text":"GRC Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Audit Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Accounting","Audit","SQL","Power BI","Python"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This is an increasingly valuable specialisation."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Options in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A postgraduate degree is not mandatory for entering audit."},{"type":"h","text":"Relevant options"},{"type":"table","header":["Qualification","Best For"],"rows":[[{"text":"M.Com"},{"text":"Accounting & audit"}],[{"text":"MBA Finance"},{"text":"Corporate finance/audit"}],[{"text":"MBA Risk Management"},{"text":"Risk/internal audit"}],[{"text":"M.Sc Business Analytics"},{"text":"Audit analytics"}],[{"text":"MCA"},{"text":"Technology-focused audit"}],[{"text":"CA"},{"text":"Professional audit/accounting"}],[{"text":"CMA"},{"text":"Cost/management accounting"}],[{"text":"ACCA"},{"text":"International accounting/audit"}],[{"text":"CIA"},{"text":"Internal audit"}],[{"text":"CISA"},{"text":"IT audit"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"For a student targeting traditional audit, professional accounting/audit qualifications can be more career-specific than a generic master's degree."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Relevant programmes include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MSc Accounting"},{"text":"MSc Accounting & Finance"},{"text":"MSc Auditing"},{"text":"MSc Finance"},{"text":"MSc Risk Management"},{"text":"MSc Business Analytics"},{"text":"MSc Forensic Accounting"},{"text":"MSc Professional Accounting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential destinations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Ireland"},{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"USA"},{"text":"Singapore"},{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Netherlands"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Professional accounting qualifications may have country-specific recognition and exemptions, so students should verify the current rules before selecting a pathway."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"External Audit"},{"type":"h","text":"Audit Intern"},{"type":"h","text":"Audit Assistant"},{"type":"h","text":"Audit Associate"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Audit Associate"},{"type":"h","text":"Audit Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Director / Partner Track"},{"type":"h","text":"Internal Audit"},{"type":"h","text":"Internal Audit Intern"},{"type":"h","text":"Internal Audit Associate"},{"type":"h","text":"Internal Auditor"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Internal Auditor"},{"type":"h","text":"Internal Audit Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Head of Internal Audit"},{"type":"h","text":"Risk & Controls"},{"type":"h","text":"Audit Assistant"},{"type":"h","text":"Controls Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Risk/Compliance Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Risk Analyst"},{"type":"h","text":"Risk Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Head of Risk / GRC"}]},{"heading":"AI-Era Auditing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Auditing is becoming increasingly data-driven."},{"type":"p","text":"AI and analytics can assist with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Transaction testing"},{"text":"Anomaly detection"},{"text":"Duplicate-payment detection"},{"text":"Journal-entry analysis"},{"text":"Document extraction"},{"text":"Risk scoring"},{"text":"Continuous monitoring"},{"text":"Fraud-pattern identification"},{"text":"Automated reconciliations"},{"text":"Contract/document analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example"},{"type":"p","text":"Traditional audit:"},{"type":"h","text":"Sample 100 transactions → manually inspect"},{"type":"p","text":"Modern audit analytics:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Analyse 1,000,000 transactions","identify anomalies","investigate high-risk items"]},{"type":"p","text":"This means future auditors need stronger data and technology skills."}]},{"heading":"Future Career Opportunities: 2040–2046","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential roles include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI Audit Analyst"},{"text":"Continuous Audit Specialist"},{"text":"Audit Data Analyst"},{"text":"Financial Controls Analytics Specialist"},{"text":"AI Governance Auditor"},{"text":"Technology Risk Analyst"},{"text":"Digital Audit Specialist"},{"text":"AI Assurance Specialist"},{"text":"Forensic Data Analyst"},{"text":"Automated Controls Specialist"},{"text":"AI Risk & Compliance Specialist"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The future auditor will increasingly combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Accounting","Audit","Risk","Data","AI"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Accounting"},{"type":"flow","items":["Financial Accounting","Financial Statements","Cost Accounting"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Audit"},{"type":"flow","items":["Audit Procedures","Internal Controls","Risk Assessment","Working Papers"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Finance"},{"type":"flow","items":["Financial Analysis","Corporate Finance","Tax Fundamentals"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"flow","items":["Excel","ERP/SAP","Power BI","SQL","Basic Python"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"flow","items":["Documentation","Communication","Analytical Thinking","Professional Ethics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Future"},{"type":"flow","items":["Audit Analytics","AI","Continuous Monitoring","Digital Controls"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal Graduate Profile"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should be able to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Prepare and understand financial statements."},{"text":"Explain core auditing concepts."},{"text":"Perform basic audit procedures."},{"text":"Conduct vouching and verification."},{"text":"Perform bank and ledger reconciliations."},{"text":"Understand internal controls."},{"text":"Identify audit risks."},{"text":"Prepare professional working papers."},{"text":"Analyse financial ratios."},{"text":"Use advanced Excel."},{"text":"Perform basic audit analytics using Power BI/SQL."},{"text":"Understand ERP-based accounting."},{"text":"Complete an audit internship."},{"text":"Prepare a complete simulated audit case."},{"text":"Understand the difference between an audit assistant role and regulated professional auditor responsibilities."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Practical Path"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com BAF","Accounting Fundamentals","Auditing","Financial Statement Analysis","Internal Controls","Excel","Tax Fundamentals","Audit Working Papers","Power BI + SQL","Audit Internship","Audit Assistant","Audit Associate","Senior Auditor","Audit Manager","Senior Manager / Professional Audit Leadership"]},{"type":"flow","items":["Accounting","Auditing","Internal Controls","Risk","Excel","Data Analytics","AI."],"sep":"+","label":"Best long-term combination"},{"type":"p","text":"For maximum career flexibility, the student can later branch into CA/ACCA/CMA/CIA, internal audit, risk & compliance, forensic audit or audit analytics depending on career goals."}]}]}